import{_ as o,o as i,c as t,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 164 | Realm Refinement · Multiverse Realm · Male Human Cultivation Path","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 164 | Realm Refinement · Multiverse Realm · Male Human Cultivation Path","no":164,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Multiverse Realm","Human Race","Male","Expansion Setting","Cultivation Path"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","17-Plane Transcendent Standard","28-Cross-Plane Anchor Connection"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0164_模块1-多元境-男性人族修炼路径.md","filePath":"en/0164_模块1-多元境-男性人族修炼路径.md"}'),s={name:"en/0164_模块1-多元境-男性人族修炼路径.md"};function a(r,e,l,u,m,c){return i(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-164-multiverse-realm-male-human-cultivation-path-pain-points-and-breakthrough-features" tabindex="-1">Entry 164 | Multiverse Realm: Male Human Cultivation Path, Pain Points, and Breakthrough Features <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-164-multiverse-realm-male-human-cultivation-path-pain-points-and-breakthrough-features" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 164 | Multiverse Realm: Male Human Cultivation Path, Pain Points, and Breakthrough Features&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 14, 17, 28</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-from-gatekeeper-of-one-cosmos-to-connector-of-many-cosmoses" tabindex="-1">Introduction: From &quot;gatekeeper of one cosmos&quot; to &quot;connector of many cosmoses&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-from-gatekeeper-of-one-cosmos-to-connector-of-many-cosmoses" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: From &quot;gatekeeper of one cosmos&quot; to &quot;connector of many cosmoses&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p><strong>[Expansion setting, pending terminology committee calibration]</strong> The Multiverse Realm is the newly added tenth realm outside the nine-realm official names (Sense/Condensed/Transform/Law/Dao/Dao Integration/Boundary-Breaking/World-Creation/Origin); its definition is established at the normative stage, and official terminology remains subject to the terminology committee&#39;s final calibration. The working definition this entry relies on is: <strong>Multiverse Realm — crossing a single cosmos&#39; boundary, governing and connecting multiple cosmoses&#39; origins, law authority upgraded to multiverse scale, promotion requiring Alaya Network-supervised multi-dimensional trials</strong>.</p><p>Male humans at the Origin Realm (Entry 157) are already Plane Transcendents of &quot;one cosmos&quot;; the Multiverse Realm requires them to take a grander step — <strong>no longer only guarding one cosmos, but connecting and governing multiple independently existing cosmoses&#39; origins</strong>. This is yet another leap of the four sacred-cultivation realms (Boundary-Breaking/World-Creation/Origin/Multiverse) at cosmic scale.</p><p>The six top-level axioms running through the text extend to &quot;multiple cosmoses&quot; here: the anti-predation axiom requires that connecting multiple cosmoses is not swallowing multiple cosmoses; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires every cosmos&#39; beings to have equal qualification; the collective ascension axiom requires him to uplift multiple cosmoses together; the causal self-discipline axiom requires cross-cosmos operations to be strictly filed; the law-first axiom ensures the Multiverse Realm expansion setting itself is self-consistent and does not conflict with the nine-realm foundation. This entry focuses on the portrait of male humans in the Multiverse Realm; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-portrait-of-male-humans-in-the-multiverse-realm" tabindex="-1">I. Portrait of Male Humans in the Multiverse Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-portrait-of-male-humans-in-the-multiverse-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Portrait of Male Humans in the Multiverse Realm&quot;">​</a></h2><p>From the Origin Realm&#39;s &quot;single-cosmos gatekeeper&quot; to the Multiverse Realm&#39;s &quot;multi-cosmos connector,&quot; male humans&#39; long boards and risks are simultaneously amplified:</p><ul><li><strong>Multi-cosmos coordination ability</strong>: male strong ones used to engineering and systems thinking are suited to designing connectivity architecture between multiple cosmoses&#39; origins</li><li><strong>Monopoly tendency escalation</strong>: able to govern multiple cosmoses&#39; origins, most prone to misreading &quot;connection&quot; as &quot;rule&quot; — escalating from cosmos master to &quot;multi-cosmos master&quot;</li><li><strong>Architecture design talent</strong>: good at designing cross-cosmos law interfaces and origin channels</li><li><strong>Scale imbalance</strong>: when scheduling between multiple cosmoses, prone to neglecting individual beings&#39; micro welfare within a single cosmos</li></ul><p>The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s handling of this endowment is strictly defining &quot;governing multiple cosmoses&quot; as &quot;connecting and serving&quot; — Multiverse Realm strong ones are not emperors of multiple cosmoses, but <strong>transportation hubs and coordinators</strong> between multiple cosmoses&#39; origins.</p><h2 id="ii-cultivation-path-complete-chain-from-origin-to-multiverse" tabindex="-1">II. Cultivation Path: Complete Chain from Origin to Multiverse <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-cultivation-path-complete-chain-from-origin-to-multiverse" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Cultivation Path: Complete Chain from Origin to Multiverse&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Multiverse Realm&#39;s working definition path has four milestones:</p><ol><li><strong>Single-cosmos completion</strong>: first doing &quot;one cosmos&#39;&quot; law fine-tuning and guarding well at the Origin Realm; this is the prerequisite for entering the Multiverse Realm</li><li><strong>Multi-cosmos perception</strong>: perceiving other cosmoses&#39; origins beyond one&#39;s own, understanding the fundamental differences among cosmoses&#39; laws</li><li><strong>Origin connection</strong>: under Alaya Network supervision, establishing stable, non-swallowing connection interfaces between multiple cosmoses&#39; origins</li><li><strong>Multi-dimensional trial certification</strong>: passing Alaya Network-supervised multi-dimensional trials, confirming possession of multiverse-scale law authority and mind</li></ol><p>For male humans, the path must actively hedge three tendencies: first, <strong>swallowing-style connection</strong>, sucking other cosmoses&#39; origins into oneself; second, <strong>scale drift</strong>, forgetting micro beings while coordinating multiple cosmoses; third, <strong>authoritarian cross-cosmos affairs</strong>. The multi-dimensional trial examines these tendencies item by item.</p><h2 id="iii-pain-points-and-costs-the-temptation-of-multiple-cosmoses" tabindex="-1">III. Pain Points and Costs: The Temptation of Multiple Cosmoses <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-pain-points-and-costs-the-temptation-of-multiple-cosmoses" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Pain Points and Costs: The Temptation of Multiple Cosmoses&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Multiverse Realm is the sentient-origin greed-shortcut inner demon&#39;s eruption at the &quot;cosmos cluster&quot; scale:</p><ul><li><strong>Swallowing temptation</strong>: when connecting multiple cosmoses, directly devouring other cosmoses&#39; origins to grow oneself — this is the predatory cosmic hegemony&#39;s ultimate form</li><li><strong>Master illusion</strong>: mistaking governing multiple cosmoses for overriding all cosmoses&#39; beings</li><li><strong>Scale disorientation</strong>: lost in multi-cosmos information floods, forgetting one&#39;s guarding original intention</li><li><strong>Cross-cosmos causal pollution</strong>: cross-cosmos operations disturb multiple cosmoses&#39; causal chains, consequences far exceeding single-cosmos</li></ul><p>Breakthrough costs: multiverse coupling failure causes simultaneous rejection by multiple cosmoses&#39; origins, at worst consciousness torn apart between the cosmos cluster. The Alaya Network and multi-layer supervision&#39;s intervention in the Multiverse Realm is &quot;multi-dimensional trials&quot; — in multiple cosmoses&#39; simulated scenarios, simultaneously examining power, mind, and causal self-discipline; any one cosmos&#39; assessment failure means overall failure.</p><h2 id="iv-breakthrough-features-from-cosmic-level-power-to-multi-cosmos-connector" tabindex="-1">IV. Breakthrough Features: From &quot;Cosmic-Level Power&quot; to &quot;Multi-Cosmos Connector&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-breakthrough-features-from-cosmic-level-power-to-multi-cosmos-connector" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Breakthrough Features: From &quot;Cosmic-Level Power&quot; to &quot;Multi-Cosmos Connector&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Markers for male humans who pass multi-dimensional trials and enter the Multiverse Realm:</p><ul><li>Crossing a single cosmos&#39; boundary, consciousness and authority covering multiple cosmoses&#39; origins</li><li>Establishing stable connections with multiple cosmoses&#39; origins, not swallowing</li><li>Law authority upgraded to multiverse scale, can coordinate law interfaces across cosmoses</li><li>Passing Alaya Network-supervised multi-dimensional trials, mind and causal self-discipline met</li></ul><p>Breakthrough is not the end — the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm (from Entry 171) awaits, upgrading multiverse connection to &quot;comprehensively balanced symbiosis of the Myriad Races origin balanced-anchor network.&quot;</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: channeling male multi-cosmos architecture ability into connection and coordination, not used to monopolize multiple cosmoses</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the Multiverse Realm explicitly forbids swallowing-style connection; connecting multiple cosmoses only does incremental interconnection</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: old-system &quot;multi-cosmos-level strong ones&quot; often devour various cosmoses; Heng Yuan Zhou Multiverse Realm strong ones only act as connection hubs</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: male humans are only one Multiverse Realm candidate; all races and planetary consciousnesses also walk this cross-cosmos road</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the Multiverse Realm&#39;s connection architecture and cross-cosmos channel design are network-public, laying the foundation for the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Multiverse Realm raises male humans&#39; horizon from &quot;one cosmos&quot; to &quot;multiple cosmoses.&quot; In predatory hands, this horizon inflates into hegemony devouring various cosmoses; in the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, it settles into a hub connecting various cosmoses. Once the cross-cosmos step carries causal filing and service original intention, multiverse is no longer swallowing, but Myriad Races shaking hands at a larger scale.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./17-位面至高强者标准.html">17-Plane Transcendent Standard</a> · <a href="./28-跨位面锚点连接.html">28-Cross-Plane Anchor Connection</a> · <a href="./04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const d=o(s,[["render",a]]);export{g as __pageData,d as default};
